{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51356","headline":"瀑布泉 · 刘禹锡","name":"瀑布泉","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"时出西郊霁色开，寻真欲去重徘徊。\n风泉净洗高人耳，松柏化爲君子材。\n翠巘絶高尖插汉，碧潭无底搅轰雷。\n上盘下际非凡境，个里何曾俗客来。\n（《正德南康府志》十《诗类》）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘禹锡","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_51356.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51356","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}